        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7039/A, Traditional Arched Keyed Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arched 7 Inch Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set is for use on any sliding door where keyed security is required. It is operated from the exterior by a Schlage C Keyway and by the interior by a thumb turn. The Traditional Arched Keyed Mortise Pocket Door Hardware comes packaged as a complete set for one door including 2 flush pulls, a keyed entry mortise box, the mortise faceplate, strike, and the mounting hardware. This Traditional Keyed Entry Pocket Door Hardware Set also features a retractable finger pull that extends when the button on the mortise faceplate is pressed, making it easy to slide the door out of its pocket.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Keyed Lock:</b> Use when a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/arched-7-inch-flush-pull-omnia-7039-0\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/arched-7-inch-pocket-door-privacy-set-omnia-7039-l\"><b>Privacy Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 7039 Pocket Door Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Case: Stamped from heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Front: Armored steel front adjustable for beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Schlage \"C\" keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Traditional Arched Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Height: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 1/2\" thick x 1-1/4\" high x 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Finger Pull: 1/2\" thick x 2\" high x 1-1/4\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7039-specifications.pdf?v=1704262371\"><b>Omnia 7039 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a keyed mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arched 7 Inch Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set",
                "description": "The Arched 7 Inch Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set is for use on any sliding door where keyed security is required. It is operated from the exterior by a Schlage C Keyway and by the interior by a thumb turn. The Traditional Arched Keyed Mortise Pocket Door Hardware comes packaged as a complete set for one door including 2 flush pulls, a keyed entry mortise box, the mortise faceplate, strike, and the mounting hardware. This Traditional Keyed Entry Pocket Door Hardware Set also features a retractable finger pull that extends when the button on the mortise faceplate is pressed, making it easy to slide the door out of its pocket.",
